1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Your sunroof stopped halfway —
won't slide open or closed?

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Not leaking, not loose —
just stuck. That's a different problem.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:15,000
One clue: dirt or dried lubricant on the track
can make it bind — a simple clean and re-grease.

4
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:21,000
But if it's the motor — worn out or a
stripped gear — that's not a cleaning job.

5
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't force it. Forcing a stuck sunroof
can turn a cheap fix into an expensive one.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking either way.
Stop by and we'll take a look.

7
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:33,000
Nick's Tire & Auto — 17625 Euclid Ave, Cleveland
